{"id":"u31","kelas":10,"no":5,"judul":"Teks Narasi","title":"Narrative Text","emoji":"🏰","ringkas":"Struktur cerita, past tense, dan urutan kejadian","ready":true,"goals":["memahami struktur **narrative text**: **Orientation**, **Complication**, **Resolution**","memakai **simple past** dan **past continuous** untuk menceritakan kejadian","memakai kata penghubung cerita: [[once upon a time]], [[one day]], [[suddenly]], [[while]], [[when]], [[finally]]","mengenali tokoh, latar (setting), masalah, dan penyelesaian dalam sebuah cerita","membaca dongeng dan cerita rakyat lalu menjawab pertanyaan tentang isinya","menceritakan kembali sebuah cerita sederhana dengan urutan yang jelas"],"lesson":[{"t":"intro","text":"Dongeng, cerita rakyat, fabel, sampai cerita pendek di buku: semuanya adalah **narrative text**, yaitu teks yang **menghibur** pembacanya lewat cerita yang punya **masalah** dan **penyelesaian**. Berbeda dengan recount yang menceritakan pengalaman nyata, narrative boleh berupa cerita khayalan. Di kelas 8 kamu sudah mengenal dasarnya. Sekarang kamu belajar menyusunnya dengan lengkap."},{"t":"grammar","title":"1. Struktur narrative text","table":[["Bagian","Isi","Contoh"],["**Orientation**","Pengenalan tokoh, tempat, dan waktu","[[Once upon a time, a poor boy lived in a small village.]]"],["**Complication**","Masalah yang muncul","[[One day, a big storm destroyed his house.]]"],["**Evaluation** (opsional)","Perasaan atau penilaian tokoh atas masalah","[[He felt very sad and afraid.]]"],["**Resolution**","Penyelesaian masalah","[[Finally, the villagers helped him build a new house.]]"],["**Coda** (opsional)","Pesan moral atau penutup","[[They lived happily ever after.]]"]]},{"t":"grammar","title":"2. Ciri kebahasaan","table":[["Ciri","Contoh"],["**Simple past** untuk kejadian utama","[[The boy walked into the forest.]]"],["**Past continuous** untuk latar kejadian","[[He was walking when he heard a noise.]]"],["**Kata penunjuk waktu** dan urutan","[[Once upon a time]], [[one day]], [[suddenly]], [[then]], [[finally]]"],["**Kata kerja tindakan** (action verbs)","[[run]], [[hide]], [[shout]], [[jump]]"],["**Dialog** dengan tanda kutip","[[\"Help me!\" the rabbit shouted.]]"]]},{"t":"vocab","title":"3. Kosakata cerita","items":[{"en":"character","id":"tokoh","ex":"The main character is a clever mouse."},{"en":"setting","id":"latar","ex":"The setting of the story is a forest."},{"en":"plot","id":"alur","ex":"The plot is easy to follow."},{"en":"problem","id":"masalah","ex":"The problem is that the river is too wide."},{"en":"solution","id":"penyelesaian","ex":"The solution is to build a bridge."},{"en":"moral value","id":"pesan moral","ex":"The moral value is: be honest."},{"en":"kingdom","id":"kerajaan","ex":"The king ruled a big kingdom."},{"en":"village","id":"desa","ex":"A farmer lived in a small village."},{"en":"cave","id":"gua","ex":"The bear slept in a cave."},{"en":"clever","id":"cerdik","ex":"The mouse was clever."},{"en":"greedy","id":"serakah","ex":"The greedy man wanted all the gold."},{"en":"brave","id":"berani","ex":"The brave girl saved her brother."},{"en":"promise","id":"berjanji / janji","ex":"He promised to come back."},{"en":"regret","id":"menyesal","ex":"He regretted his mistake."}]},{"t":"grammar","title":"4. Simple past dan past continuous","text":"**Simple past** menceritakan kejadian yang selesai. **Past continuous** (was/were + V-ing) menceritakan kegiatan yang **sedang berlangsung** ketika kejadian lain terjadi. Hubungkan keduanya dengan **when** dan **while**.","table":[["Pola","Contoh"],["Simple past","[[The rabbit jumped into the river.]]"],["Past continuous","[[The farmer was sleeping under a tree.]]"],["**while** + past continuous","[[While the farmer was sleeping, the rabbit ate his carrots.]]"],["**when** + simple past","[[The farmer was sleeping when the rabbit came.]]"]]},{"t":"warn","title":"Jangan campur bentuk waktu","text":"Benar: [[She was cooking when the lights went out.]] Salah: *She cooking when the lights go out.* Dalam cerita, pakai **past tense** secara konsisten."},{"t":"grammar","title":"5. Kata penghubung dalam cerita","table":[["Kata","Fungsi","Contoh"],["[[once upon a time]]","pembuka dongeng","[[Once upon a time, there was a king.]]"],["[[one day]]","menandai masalah muncul","[[One day, a stranger came.]]"],["[[suddenly]]","kejadian tiba-tiba","[[Suddenly, the ground shook.]]"],["[[because]]","sebab","[[He ran because he was afraid.]]"],["[[so]]","akibat","[[It was dark, so he lit a candle.]]"],["[[finally]]","akhirnya","[[Finally, they found the way home.]]"]]},{"t":"dialog","title":"Teks 1: The Clever Mouse","lines":[{"who":"Orientation","en":"Once upon a time, a little mouse lived in a big forest. He was small, but he was very clever.","id":"Pada suatu hari dahulu, seekor tikus kecil tinggal di hutan yang besar. Dia kecil, tetapi sangat cerdik."},{"who":"Complication","en":"One day, a hungry cat saw the mouse. \"I will eat you!\" said the cat. The mouse was very afraid.","id":"Suatu hari, seekor kucing yang lapar melihat tikus itu. \"Aku akan memakanmu!\" kata kucing. Tikus itu sangat takut."},{"who":"Complication","en":"Suddenly, the mouse said, \"Wait! I am too thin. Look at the river. There are fat fish in it.\"","id":"Tiba-tiba tikus berkata, \"Tunggu! Aku terlalu kurus. Lihat sungai itu. Ada ikan gemuk di sana.\""},{"who":"Resolution","en":"The cat looked at the river. While he was looking at the fish, the mouse ran into a small hole. The cat could not catch him.","id":"Kucing melihat ke sungai. Selagi dia memandangi ikan, tikus berlari ke lubang kecil. Kucing tidak bisa menangkapnya."},{"who":"Coda","en":"The moral value: a clever mind can save you from danger.","id":"Pesan moral: pikiran yang cerdik dapat menyelamatkanmu dari bahaya."}]},{"t":"dialog","title":"Teks 2: The Honest Woodcutter","lines":[{"who":"Orientation","en":"Long ago, an honest woodcutter lived near a river. Every day he cut wood and sold it in the market.","id":"Dahulu kala, seorang penebang kayu yang jujur tinggal di dekat sungai. Setiap hari dia menebang kayu dan menjualnya di pasar."},{"who":"Complication","en":"One day, while he was cutting a tree, his axe fell into the river. He could not swim, so he sat down and cried.","id":"Suatu hari, ketika dia sedang menebang pohon, kapaknya jatuh ke sungai. Dia tidak bisa berenang, jadi dia duduk dan menangis."},{"who":"Evaluation","en":"He was very sad because the axe was his only tool.","id":"Dia sangat sedih karena kapak itu satu-satunya alatnya."},{"who":"Resolution","en":"Suddenly, a kind spirit came out of the water with a gold axe. \"Is this yours?\" she asked. \"No,\" said the woodcutter. At last, she gave him his old axe and a gold one because he was honest.","id":"Tiba-tiba, seorang peri baik hati keluar dari air membawa kapak emas. \"Apakah ini milikmu?\" tanyanya. \"Bukan,\" kata penebang kayu. Akhirnya, dia memberinya kapak lamanya dan juga kapak emas karena dia jujur."}]},{"t":"dialog","title":"Dialog: Menceritakan dongeng","lines":[{"who":"Tom","en":"Dina, do you know the story of Malin Kundang?","id":"Dina, kamu tahu cerita Malin Kundang?"},{"who":"Dina","en":"Yes, I do. A poor boy left his village and became rich. But when he came back, he was ashamed of his mother.","id":"Ya. Seorang anak miskin meninggalkan desanya dan menjadi kaya. Tetapi ketika dia pulang, dia malu pada ibunya."},{"who":"Tom","en":"What happened in the end?","id":"Bagaimana akhirnya?"},{"who":"Dina","en":"His mother was very angry, so she cursed him. He turned into a stone. The moral value is: respect your parents.","id":"Ibunya sangat marah, jadi dia mengutuknya. Anak itu berubah menjadi batu. Pesan moralnya: hormati orang tuamu."}]},{"t":"tip","title":"Membaca cerita dengan cerdas","text":"Setelah membaca, tanyakan lima hal: **Siapa** tokohnya? **Di mana dan kapan** latarnya? **Apa** masalahnya? **Bagaimana** penyelesaiannya? **Apa** pesan moralnya? Jawabannya hampir selalu ada di Orientation, Complication, dan Resolution."},{"t":"summary","items":["Struktur: **Orientation → Complication → (Evaluation) → Resolution** (+ Coda).","Kejadian utama pakai **simple past**; latar kejadian pakai **past continuous**.","Kata cerita: [[once upon a time]], [[one day]], [[suddenly]], [[finally]].","[[while]] + past continuous, [[when]] + simple past.","Setelah membaca, cari tokoh, latar, masalah, penyelesaian, dan pesan moral."]}],"practice":[{"type":"match","q":"Pasangkan kosakata dengan artinya:","pairs":[["character","tokoh"],["setting","latar"],["problem","masalah"],["solution","penyelesaian"],["moral value","pesan moral"]],"exp":"Kosakata dasar untuk membahas cerita.","k":"aa7a5ab3"},{"type":"match","q":"Pasangkan kata sifat dengan artinya:","pairs":[["clever","cerdik"],["greedy","serakah"],["brave","berani"],["honest","jujur"]],"exp":"Sifat tokoh sering muncul dalam cerita.","k":"fe592665"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Bagian narrative text yang memperkenalkan tokoh dan latar adalah...","options":["Orientation","Complication","Resolution","Coda"],"answer":0,"exp":"Orientation = pengenalan tokoh, tempat, dan waktu.","k":"ce652979"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Bagian narrative text yang berisi masalah adalah...","options":["Orientation","Complication","Resolution","Title"],"answer":1,"exp":"Complication = masalah yang muncul.","k":"97d9ea78"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Bagian narrative text yang berisi penyelesaian adalah...","options":["Orientation","Complication","Resolution","Goal"],"answer":2,"exp":"Resolution = penyelesaian masalah.","k":"52e79a4f"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Tujuan utama narrative text adalah...","options":["menghibur pembaca dengan cerita","menjelaskan cara membuat sesuatu","mengumumkan acara","mendeskripsikan satu benda"],"answer":0,"exp":"Narrative menghibur lewat cerita.","k":"a02d87b3"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kalimat pembuka dongeng yang tepat adalah...","options":["Once upon a time, there was a king.","First, mix the flour.","Yesterday, I went to the zoo.","Please come to my party."],"answer":0,"exp":"Once upon a time khas untuk dongeng.","k":"a69f7dda"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih bentuk yang benar: \"The rabbit ___ into the river.\"","options":["jump","jumped","jumping","jumps"],"answer":1,"exp":"Kejadian yang selesai memakai simple past.","k":"68cc8de0"},{"type":"fill","id":"Dahulu seorang raja tinggal di istana.","q":"Once upon a time, a king ___ in a palace. (live)","answers":["lived"],"hint":"simple past","exp":"Cerita memakai simple past.","k":"b6e6b01e"},{"type":"fill","id":"Tiba-tiba tanah bergetar.","q":"___, the ground shook.","answers":["Suddenly"],"hint":"kata keterangan","exp":"Suddenly = tiba-tiba.","k":"6fcd0212"},{"type":"fill","id":"Saat dia tidur, tikus itu lari.","q":"While he ___ sleeping, the mouse ran away.","answers":["was"],"hint":"was / were ?","exp":"He + was; while + past continuous.","k":"30fc0674"},{"type":"fill","id":"Mereka sedang bermain ketika hujan turun.","q":"They were playing ___ it rained.","answers":["when"],"hint":"ketika","exp":"when + simple past.","k":"5061f83b"},{"type":"fill","id":"Dia takut, jadi dia bersembunyi.","q":"He was afraid, ___ he hid.","answers":["so"],"hint":"akibat","exp":"so menyatakan akibat.","k":"64649ffb"},{"type":"order","q":"Susun kalimat: \"Suatu hari, seekor rubah yang lapar melihat anggur.\"","answer":"One day, a hungry fox saw some grapes.","exp":"One day, + kalimat simple past.","k":"2a303baf"},{"type":"order","q":"Susun kalimat: \"Penebang kayu itu jujur.\"","answer":"The woodcutter was honest.","exp":"was + kata sifat.","k":"8b508761"},{"type":"order","q":"Susun kalimat: \"Akhirnya mereka menemukan jalan pulang.\"","answer":"Finally, they found the way home.","exp":"Finally, + simple past.","k":"d6dd3608"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kalimat mana yang benar?","options":["The farmer was sleeping when the rabbit came.","The farmer sleeping when the rabbit come.","The farmer sleep when the rabbit came.","The farmer is sleeping when the rabbit came."],"answer":0,"exp":"past continuous + when + simple past.","k":"25a3cea7"},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Apa artinya?","say":"Once upon a time there was a king","options":["Pada suatu ketika ada seorang raja","Kemarin raja itu datang","Raja itu sangat kaya","Raja itu pergi ke pasar"],"answer":0,"exp":"Once upon a time = pada suatu ketika.","k":"9aa6d187"},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Apa artinya?","say":"Suddenly the mouse ran into a small hole","options":["Tiba-tiba tikus itu berlari ke lubang kecil","Tikus itu tidur di lubang","Tikus itu makan keju","Tikus itu menggali tanah"],"answer":0,"exp":"suddenly = tiba-tiba; hole = lubang.","k":"79c9fc1d"},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Apa artinya?","say":"He regretted his mistake","options":["Dia menyesali kesalahannya","Dia mengulangi kesalahannya","Dia melupakan janjinya","Dia membantu temannya"],"answer":0,"exp":"regret = menyesal.","k":"4da202c6"},{"type":"fill","id":"Dahulu ada seorang petani miskin.","q":"Once upon a time, there ___ a poor farmer. (be)","answers":["was"],"hint":"was / were ?","exp":"a poor farmer = tunggal, jadi was.","k":"04c3b279"},{"type":"fill","id":"Anak itu berlari ke hutan.","q":"The boy ___ into the forest. (run)","answers":["ran"],"hint":"past tense tak beraturan","exp":"run → ran.","k":"dfca486e"},{"type":"fill","id":"Putri itu menangis karena sedih.","q":"The princess ___ because she was sad. (cry)","answers":["cried"],"hint":"simple past","exp":"cry → cried.","k":"886bf31d"},{"type":"fill","id":"Serigala itu melihat anak domba.","q":"The wolf ___ a little lamb. (see)","answers":["saw"],"hint":"past tense tak beraturan","exp":"see → saw.","k":"6b78f42f"},{"type":"fill","id":"Mereka sedang berjalan ketika hujan turun.","q":"They ___ walking when it started to rain.","answers":["were"],"hint":"was / were ?","exp":"They + were.","k":"5b896c9f"},{"type":"fill","id":"Saat ibu memasak, anak itu bermain.","q":"___ Mother was cooking, the child played.","answers":["While"],"hint":"selagi","exp":"While + past continuous.","k":"a871210d"},{"type":"fill","id":"Raja itu memberi hadiah karena dia senang.","q":"The king gave a gift ___ he was happy.","answers":["because"],"hint":"sebab","exp":"because menyatakan sebab.","k":"cd17c9c3"},{"type":"fill","id":"Dia mengambil tongkat dan memukul pintu.","q":"He ___ a stick and hit the door. (take)","answers":["took"],"hint":"past tense tak beraturan","exp":"take → took.","k":"59520975"},{"type":"fill","id":"Kancil itu bersembunyi di semak-semak.","q":"The mouse deer ___ in the bushes. (hide)","answers":["hid"],"hint":"past tense tak beraturan","exp":"hide → hid.","k":"d2fd7a5b"},{"type":"fill","id":"Dia menyesal.","q":"He ___ his mistake. (regret)","answers":["regretted"],"hint":"simple past","exp":"regret → regretted.","k":"a95d57ff"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Siapa \"tokoh utama\" dalam cerita?","options":["orang atau hewan yang paling penting dalam cerita","penulis cerita","pembaca cerita","judul cerita"],"answer":0,"exp":"Main character = tokoh utama.","k":"95cf7f0e"},{"type":"mcq","q":"\"The story happens in a small village.\" Kata \"village\" menunjukkan...","options":["tokoh","latar tempat","masalah","pesan moral"],"answer":1,"exp":"Village = desa, yaitu latar tempat.","k":"c13b616d"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kata yang tepat: \"He was sleeping ___ the thief came in.\"","options":["when","while","because","but"],"answer":0,"exp":"when + simple past (came).","k":"b5b06339"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kata yang tepat: \"The cat was watching the fish ___ the mouse escaped.\"","options":["when","while","or","than"],"answer":1,"exp":"while + past continuous kejadian bersamaan.","k":"f83b3894"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kalimat mana yang termasuk Evaluation?","options":["Once upon a time, there was a king.","He felt very lonely and afraid.","The king found a friend.","They lived happily."],"answer":1,"exp":"Evaluation berisi perasaan tokoh.","k":"3a82e556"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Cerita rakyat \"Malin Kundang\" mengajarkan kita untuk...","options":["menghormati orang tua","berbohong demi uang","pergi tanpa pamit","menjadi serakah"],"answer":0,"exp":"Moral value cerita ini: hormati orang tuamu.","k":"6b8546fc"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kata \"suddenly\" menunjukkan kejadian yang...","options":["terjadi tiba-tiba","terjadi setiap hari","akan terjadi besok","tidak pernah terjadi"],"answer":0,"exp":"suddenly = tiba-tiba.","k":"3ad9a449"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih kalimat dengan past tense yang benar.","options":["The brave girl save her brother.","The brave girl saved her brother.","The brave girl saving her brother.","The brave girl saves her brother yesterday."],"answer":1,"exp":"Cerita memakai simple past.","k":"1449570a"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Fabel adalah cerita yang tokohnya...","options":["hewan yang berperilaku seperti manusia","hanya benda mati","hanya raja dan ratu","tokoh sejarah nyata"],"answer":0,"exp":"Fabel = cerita dengan tokoh hewan.","k":"c56573f6"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Cerita dengan kalimat pembuka \"Long ago ...\" termasuk teks...","options":["narrative","procedure","announcement","descriptive"],"answer":0,"exp":"Long ago / once upon a time = ciri narrative.","k":"45ea1add"},{"type":"order","q":"Susun kalimat: \"Penyihir itu tinggal di dalam gua.\"","answer":"The witch lived in a cave.","exp":"Simple past + keterangan tempat.","k":"a7ebab29"},{"type":"order","q":"Susun kalimat: \"Dia sedang tidur ketika pencuri datang.\"","answer":"He was sleeping when the thief came.","exp":"past continuous + when + simple past.","k":"ac0774aa"},{"type":"match","q":"Pasangkan kata dengan artinya:","pairs":[["kingdom","kerajaan"],["cave","gua"],["village","desa"],["plot","alur"]],"exp":"Kosakata latar dan alur cerita.","k":"7b72e9dd"},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Apa artinya?","say":"The brave girl saved her brother","options":["Gadis pemberani itu menyelamatkan adiknya","Gadis itu takut pada adiknya","Gadis itu memarahi adiknya","Gadis itu kehilangan adiknya"],"answer":0,"exp":"brave = berani; saved = menyelamatkan.","k":"395569a5"},{"type":"fill","id":"Dahulu kala ada seorang putri yang cantik.","q":"Once upon a time, there ___ a beautiful princess.","answers":["was"],"hint":"to be lampau","exp":"was.","k":"8cfc27b1"},{"type":"fill","id":"Naga itu hidup di gua.","q":"The dragon ___ in a cave. (live)","answers":["lived"],"hint":"V2","exp":"lived.","k":"a80258d6"},{"type":"fill","id":"Pangeran mengambil pedangnya.","q":"The prince ___ his sword. (take)","answers":["took"],"hint":"V2","exp":"take → took.","k":"d6f8fc8c"},{"type":"fill","id":"Tiba-tiba hujan turun.","q":"___, it started to rain.","answers":["Suddenly"],"hint":"tiba-tiba","exp":"Suddenly.","k":"eba2e263"},{"type":"fill","id":"Akhirnya mereka hidup bahagia.","q":"In the end, they lived ___ ever after.","answers":["happily"],"hint":"dengan bahagia","exp":"happily ever after.","k":"95289112"},{"type":"fill","id":"Saat dia tidur, pencuri masuk.","q":"While he ___ sleeping, a thief came in.","answers":["was"],"hint":"past continuous","exp":"while + was + V-ing.","k":"b37bb2ca"},{"type":"fill","id":"Dia sedang berjalan ketika melihat dompet.","q":"She was ___ when she saw a wallet. (walk)","answers":["walking"],"hint":"V-ing","exp":"was walking.","k":"37e82b24"},{"type":"fill","id":"Petani itu sangat miskin.","q":"The farmer was very ___.","answers":["poor"],"hint":"miskin","exp":"poor.","k":"0402b614"},{"type":"fill","id":"Dia lari karena takut.","q":"He ran away because he was ___.","answers":["afraid","scared"],"hint":"takut","exp":"afraid/scared.","k":"75e74695"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Bagian narrative yang memuat masalah/konflik:","options":["complication","orientation","resolution","coda"],"answer":0,"exp":"Complication.","k":"b0980b0a"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Bagian yang memuat penyelesaian masalah:","options":["resolution","orientation","title","complication"],"answer":0,"exp":"Resolution.","k":"7d2afcbb"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Tokoh jahat dalam cerita disebut...","options":["villain","hero","audience","narrator"],"answer":0,"exp":"vil